Baker mentioned that serves the whole city, such as

01:48:35.960 --> 01:48:39.340
water stations, wastewater facilities that are

01:48:39.840 --> 01:48:43.820
needed that would constrain growth across the whole city if they weren't moved forward is

01:48:44.320 --> 01:48:47.740
what we've prioritized. Thank you. I think that's very important for

01:48:48.240 --> 01:48:53.620
people to hear. I want to go to Bill 60 land acquisition class,

01:48:54.120 --> 01:48:55.060
the new class system.

01:48:57.460 --> 01:49:01.190
It's implied, and I think that you stated it, that there is a

01:49:01.690 --> 01:49:05.710
