01:49:13.390 --> 01:49:17.230
We have an 8% or more tax increase this

01:49:17.730 --> 01:49:21.190
year. What you're telling me is that the new normal

01:49:21.690 --> 01:49:24.430
is 8% and beyond. And I was wondering if you could comment on that please.

01:49:27.160 --> 01:49:30.360
Through the chair, I might have to help, you might have to help me parse

01:49:30.860 --> 01:49:34.820
that question apart a little bit, Councillor Ault. So the land acquisition class,

01:49:35.320 --> 01:49:38.720
so that is, that essentially will

01:49:39.220 --> 01:49:42.520
